# EU Publications Office — rate-limited, returns 403 from CI.
https://op\.europa\.eu/

# CDC — bot-blocks the CI runner (403 Forbidden), link resolves in a browser.
https://www\.cdc\.gov/ccindex/

# Vale (vale.sh) — intermittently resets the CI runner connection
# ("Connection reset by peer"); site is live (HTTP 200 via Netlify Edge).
https://vale\.sh/
